# Testing Requirements

- Every service module must have a corresponding `.test.ts` file.
- Test edge cases: duplicate names (P2002), missing records (P2025), permission denials.
- Run `vitest related --run` via lint-staged before commits.
- Never ship a new service function without at least one happy-path and one error-path test.

# Test Patterns

- Mock Prisma with `vi.mock("@/lib/db")` and typed mock objects.
- Use `vi.clearAllMocks()` in `beforeEach` to isolate tests.
- Test `handleServiceError` mapping independently in `src/lib/api-errors.test.ts`.
